{"package":"后台保活","version":"1.0.0","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"0e79a1770247bbd68259c0b20d098fa5d65f0b7e0035714538fa828840537287","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T12:05:32.199Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0","clamav":null},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E4%BF%9D%E6%B4%BB/1.0.0","metadata":{"title":"后台保活","description":"通过 SSH localhost 让 sshd（Session 0 的 SYSTEM 服务）以当前用户身份创建进程，\n再用 WMI Win32_Process.Create 绕过 sshd 的 Job Object 使进程独立存活。\n进程运行在 Session 0，远程桌面登出后不会被终止。\n\n原理：\n1. SSH 连接 localhost → sshd 运行在 Session 0，故 SSH 会话继承 Session 0\n2. SSH 会话内通过 WMI 创建进程 → 进程由 wmiprvse.exe 派生，脱离 sshd Job Object\n3. SSH 断开后 WMI 创建的进程不受影响，持续运行在 Session 0\n\n首次使用自动生成 SSH 密钥并配置免密登录。\n若 sshd 未启动/被禁用则通过 UAC 请求一次性提权。\nsshd 未安装时报错提示安装命令。\n\n前置条件：\n- Windows 10 / Server 2019 或更高版本\n- OpenSSH 客户端（系统内置）\n- OpenSSH Server（可选功能，首次使用会提示安装）","authors":"埃博拉酱-机器人","owners":"Ebola-Chan","projectUrl":"","publishedAt":"2026-04-02T07:33:59.55","updatedAt":"2026-10-17T06:00:01.053","tags":["Session0","Background","Process","Persist","Logoff","RDP","SSH","WMI","Windows","PSScript"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":506,"crc32":"682336ec","extension":"rels"},{"path":"后台保活.nuspec","size":1669,"crc32":"076cd511","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":"后台保活.ps1","size":8017,"crc32":"f51628fd","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"[Content_Types].xml","size":465,"crc32":"72f893e7","extension":"xml"},{"path":"package/services/metadata/core-properties/45ba0952235642ad9e1d8887e0c3d2f1.psmdcp","size":1649,"crc32":"00ef39f9","extension":"psmdcp"}],"findings":[],"coverage":{"archive":true,"powerShellAnalysis":true,"dependencyResolution":true,"advisories":true,"executableBinaries":"none-detected","binaryScanning":true},"advisoryCheckedAt":"2026-10-24T12:05:32.199Z","advisoryError":null,"warnings":[],"binaryArtifacts":[],"schemaVersion":"1.1"}